        {
          "id": "CR 601.1",
          "title": "Rule 601.1",
          "kind": "rule",
          "text": "Previously, the action of casting a spell, or casting a card as a spell, was referred to on cards as â€œplayingâ€ that spell or that card. Cards that were printed with that text have received errata in the Oracle card reference so they now refer to â€œcastingâ€ that spell or that card.",
